{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-observer-api","title":"PerformanceObserver API 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/collection/performance-observer-api","wordCount":716,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"performanceobserver-api-实战\">PerformanceObserver API 实战</h1><p>PerformanceObserver 是所有现代性能采集方案的底层入口。与 <code>performance.getEntries()</code> 的一次性快照不同，Observer 以异步回调的方式在性能条目可用时立即通知你——不阻塞主线程、不遗漏后产生的条目。从 web-vitals 库到 Sentry SDK，所有商业和开源 RUM 方案的内核都是对这个 API 的封装。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PerformanceObserver 遵循观察者模式（Observer Pattern）：注册你关心的条目类型，浏览器在条目产生时回调你。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用代码&#10;    participant PO as PerformanceObserver&#10;    participant Browser as 浏览器性能子系统&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;PO: new PerformanceObserver(callback)&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;PO: observe({ type, buffered: true })&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;PO: 产生性能条目&#10;    PO-&gt;&gt;App: 回调 (PerformanceObserverEntryList)&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;PO: 产生更多条目&#10;    PO-&gt;&gt;App: 回调 (批量)&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;PO: disconnect()\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用代码\n    participant PO as PerformanceObserver\n    participant Browser as 浏览器性能子系统\n    App-&gt;&gt;PO: new PerformanceObserver(callback)\n    App-&gt;&gt;PO: observe({ type, buffered: true })\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;PO: 产生性能条目\n    PO-&gt;&gt;App: 回调 (PerformanceObserverEntryList)\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;PO: 产生更多条目\n    PO-&gt;&gt;App: 回调 (批量)\n    App-&gt;&gt;PO: disconnect()</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>type</code></td>\n<td>观察的条目类型（单一）</td>\n<td>按需选择具体类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entryTypes</code></td>\n<td>观察多种类型（旧 API）</td>\n<td>新代码优先用 <code>type</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>buffered</code></td>\n<td>是否回放注册前已产生的条目</td>\n<td><code>true</code>（避免遗漏）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>durationThreshold</code></td>\n<td>Event Timing 的最小 duration 过滤</td>\n<td><code>16</code>（采集所有交互）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基础使用模式\">基础使用模式</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 采集 LCP&#10;const lcpObserver = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  const entries = list.getEntries();&#10;  // LCP 持续更新，取最后一个为最终值&#10;  const lastEntry = entries[entries.length - 1];&#10;  console.log(&#39;LCP:&#39;, lastEntry.startTime, lastEntry.element);&#10;});&#10;lcpObserver.observe({ type: &#39;largest-contentful-paint&#39;, buffered: true });&#10;&#10;// 采集 Layout Shift（CLS 计算基础）&#10;let clsValue = 0;&#10;let sessionEntries: PerformanceEntry[] = [];&#10;&#10;const clsObserver = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries() as any[]) {&#10;    // 只统计非用户触发的偏移&#10;    if (!entry.hadRecentInput) {&#10;      sessionEntries.push(entry);&#10;      clsValue += entry.value;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;clsObserver.observe({ type: &#39;layout-shift&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 采集 LCP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lcpObserver</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // LCP 持续更新，取最后一个为最终值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lastEntry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entries[entries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LCP:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lastEntry.startTime, lastEntry.element);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lcpObserver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'largest-contentful-paint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 采集 Layout Shift（CLS 计算基础）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clsValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sessionEntries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> clsObserver</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 只统计非用户触发的偏移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">entry.hadRecentInput) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sessionEntries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entry);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      clsValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">clsObserver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'layout-shift'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>buffered: true</code> 至关重要——性能 SDK 通常是异步加载的，如果不回放注册前的条目，早期产生的 LCP、FP 等关键数据会被永久遗漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条目类型与浏览器支持\">条目类型与浏览器支持</h2><p>不同条目类型的支持情况和特性需要通过 <code>PerformanceObserver.supportedEntryTypes</code> 动态检测：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 检测支持的条目类型&#10;const supported = PerformanceObserver.supportedEntryTypes;&#10;console.log(supported);&#10;// Chrome 126+: [&#39;element&#39;, &#39;event&#39;, &#39;first-input&#39;, &#39;largest-contentful-paint&#39;,&#10;//  &#39;layout-shift&#39;, &#39;long-animation-frame&#39;, &#39;longtask&#39;, &#39;mark&#39;, &#39;measure&#39;,&#10;//  &#39;navigation&#39;, &#39;paint&#39;, &#39;resource&#39;, &#39;visibility-state&#39;]&#10;&#10;// 安全检测后再注册&#10;if (supported.includes(&#39;long-animation-frame&#39;)) {&#10;  const loafObserver = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;    for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;      // 处理 LoAF 条目&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;  loafObserver.observe({ type: &#39;long-animation-frame&#39;, buffered: true });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检测支持的条目类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> supported</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PerformanceObserver.supportedEntryTypes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(supported);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Chrome 126+: ['element', 'event', 'first-input', 'largest-contentful-paint',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//  'layout-shift', 'long-animation-frame', 'longtask', 'mark', 'measure',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//  'navigation', 'paint', 'resource', 'visibility-state']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 安全检测后再注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (supported.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'long-animation-frame'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> loafObserver</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 处理 LoAF 条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loafObserver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'long-animation-frame'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条目类型</th>\n<th>Chrome</th>\n<th>Firefox</th>\n<th>Safari</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>navigation</code></td>\n<td>57+</td>\n<td>58+</td>\n<td>15+</td>\n<td>页面导航时间线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resource</code></td>\n<td>57+</td>\n<td>58+</td>\n<td>15+</td>\n<td>资源加载详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>paint</code></td>\n<td>60+</td>\n<td>84+</td>\n<td>14.1+</td>\n<td>FP/FCP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>largest-contentful-paint</code></td>\n<td>77+</td>\n<td>122+</td>\n<td>--</td>\n<td>LCP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>layout-shift</code></td>\n<td>77+</td>\n<td>--</td>\n<td>--</td>\n<td>CLS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>event</code></td>\n<td>96+</td>\n<td>--</td>\n<td>--</td>\n<td>INP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>long-animation-frame</code></td>\n<td>123+</td>\n<td>--</td>\n<td>--</td>\n<td>脚本级归因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Safari 和 Firefox 对 CLS/INP 底层 API 的支持仍有限，这意味着 Field Data（CrUX）主要来自 Chrome 用户。RUM 平台通常通过 polyfill 或近似算法补偿非 Chrome 浏览器的数据缺失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高级模式-多-observer-协调\">高级模式：多 Observer 协调</h2><p>生产环境中通常需要同时观察多种条目，并且在页面卸载前安全地完成最终数据提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class PerformanceCollector {&#10;  private observers: PerformanceObserver[] = [];&#10;  private metrics: Map&lt;string, number&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  observe(type: string, handler: (entries: PerformanceEntryList) =&gt; void) {&#10;    if (!PerformanceObserver.supportedEntryTypes.includes(type)) return;&#10;&#10;    const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; handler(list.getEntries()));&#10;    observer.observe({ type, buffered: true });&#10;    this.observers.push(observer);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  flush() {&#10;    // 在页面隐藏时触发最终数据提交&#10;    this.observers.forEach((o) =&gt; o.takeRecords()); // 获取未回调的条目&#10;    this.report();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private report() {&#10;    // 使用 navigator.sendBeacon 确保数据不丢失&#10;    navigator.sendBeacon(&#39;/api/perf&#39;, JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(this.metrics)));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  destroy() {&#10;    this.observers.forEach((o) =&gt; o.disconnect());&#10;    this.observers = [];&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceCollector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> observers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceEntryList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PerformanceObserver.supportedEntryTypes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(type)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.observers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(observer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  flush</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 在页面隐藏时触发最终数据提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.observers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">takeRecords</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 获取未回调的条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 使用 navigator.sendBeacon 确保数据不丢失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    navigator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendBeacon</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/perf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  destroy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.observers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">disconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.observers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>takeRecords()</code> 方法从 Observer 中取出尚未通过回调传递的缓冲条目——在 <code>visibilitychange</code> 事件中调用它可以确保页面被隐藏/关闭时不丢失最后一批数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能影响与最佳实践\">性能影响与最佳实践</h2><p>PerformanceObserver 本身开销极低（微秒级），但不当使用仍可能产生问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>回调中避免同步 DOM 操作</strong>：回调在主线程执行，重操作会延长当前帧</li>\n<li><strong>批量处理条目</strong>：浏览器可能在一次回调中传递多个条目，遍历时不要每条都发网络请求</li>\n<li><strong>及时 disconnect</strong>：SPA 路由切换后记得断开旧 Observer</li>\n<li><strong>durationThreshold 调优</strong>：Event Timing 默认只报告 &gt; 104ms 的交互，设为 16 可捕获所有交互</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PerformanceObserver 是异步、非阻塞的性能条目采集入口</li>\n<li><code>buffered: true</code> 确保不遗漏 SDK 加载前的条目</li>\n<li>不同浏览器支持的条目类型差异显著，需动态检测</li>\n<li><code>takeRecords()</code> + <code>sendBeacon()</code> 组合保证页面卸载时数据完整</li>\n<li>Observer 回调开销极低，但回调内避免重操作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"web-vitals-library\">web-vitals 库与归因采集</a>——在 PerformanceObserver 之上的标准化封装</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frontend-observability/monitoring-fundamentals/data-collection\">前端可观测性 — 数据采集基础</a>——更广域的前端数据采集架构设计</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"PerformanceObserver API 实战","id":"performanceobserver-api-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础使用模式","id":"基础使用模式"},{"level":2,"text":"条目类型与浏览器支持","id":"条目类型与浏览器支持"},{"level":2,"text":"高级模式：多 Observer 协调","id":"高级模式-多-observer-协调"},{"level":2,"text":"性能影响与最佳实践","id":"性能影响与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"浏览器性能时间线 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/foundations/browser-performance-timeline"},"next":{"title":"web-vitals 库与归因采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/collection/web-vitals-library"}}